  <item>
    <title>鸡娃路漫漫，卷还是不卷？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/657086068593f10bf9d5485e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">657086068593f10bf9d5485e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 06 Dec 2023 14:32:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>育儿路上，鸡娃是我们难以绕过的话题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>条条鸡娃路，我们如何选择？</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么我们厌恶鸡娃却又投入其中？</span></p><span></span><p><span>鸡娃的尽头又是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天，来听听三位不同阶段的家长聊聊他们的鸡娃观。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期听点】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="164">2:44</a>陪读、搞情报，鸡娃妈妈的工作你做到位了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">6:00</a> 鸡娃，从备孕、不从找伴侣开始。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">8:00</a>放弃海淀户口，只为孩子一个轻松点的童年，值不值得？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="579">9:39</a> 面对幼升小，随波逐流的王新也要迎浪而上了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="802">13:22</a> 择校，开启了范范无止境的焦虑。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1042">17:22</a> 教养的迷思——环境对娃的影响有多重要。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1354">22:34</a> 娃拼学习、妈拼情报、爸拼资源，把鸡娃的项目搞起来。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a> 主动鸡娃、佛系育儿，不论结局如何，终究是妈妈背负了压力和焦虑。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1912">31:52</a> 关于中外教育体制的探讨，和在单一评价体系内不得自拔的我们。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2106">35:06</a> 《基因彩票》：后天拼得过基因吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">40:50</a> 对于的孩子的养育是在弥补我们自己的遗憾吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2628">43:48</a> 我们是否能接受自己孩子的平凡、接受自己的平凡？还是说为了成为平凡人，我们已经拼尽了全力。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2935">48:55</a>鸡娃的尽头是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期聊咖】</span></p><span></span><p><span>王新｜卫玮｜老廖</span></p><span></span><p><span>特邀嘉宾：范范</span></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Fizzing Business - Deep East Music</span></p><span></span><p><span>Piano Sonata, K.330 - Glenn Gould</span></p>]]></description>
