  <item>
    <title>烦恼吧，趁我们还有份工可以做</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64a658a1b21ecc647d7c8623</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64a658a1b21ecc647d7c8623</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 06 Jul 2023 06:01:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你有日常不想工作的时候么？人到中年是不是有失业的焦虑，甚至担心被AI取代？辞职做自由职业靠谱么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾的职场现状：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>雨珈：自由职业译者</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>卫玮：自由职业创意人</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>还行：曾经的村官，现役广告文案</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>王新：体制内公务员，刚下乡做第一书记</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>Rach：现役广告人</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>老廖：医疗营销运营</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>【本 期 听 点】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="253">04:13</a> 本期嘉宾还行的超霸气职场title——卫生间换纸者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="338">05:38</a> 王书记履新记&amp;行姐做大学生村官的日常</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="502">08:22</a> 一堂表演课，成了雨珈决定不当老师的最后稻草</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="885">14:45</a> 当年卫玮的广告理想，以及Rach进入广告业竟然是因为一个电视剧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1066">17:46</a> 曾经的村官哭着开车30公里上班，却很满意目前的工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1318">21:58</a> 雨珈的幸运，以及自由职业的真相</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1573">26:13</a> 我们的工作是否真的毫无意义？Rach的导师这样说——</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">30:05</a> 中年职场人求职的残酷现实</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2138">35:38</a> 关于工作的剥离感大讨论从这开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2418">40:18</a> 王新现场演示如何高情商救场的，然而他却是一个无法剥离的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2699">44:59</a> AI唯一不会做的一件事是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2736">45:36</a> 最后，行姐一段正儿八经的贯口送给大家：所以我们的工作真的有意义么~</span></p><span></span><p><span>雨珈推荐的书：《毫无意义的工作》</span></p><span></span><p><span>作者：大卫·格雷伯</span></p><span></span><p><span>译者：吕宇珺</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvrKD0Rs_gIHvTyObxUuNtAFaqUR.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>BGM：Loom - Ólafur Arnalds/Bonobo</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvmU5N6vhHgQtd-x9w4VvF1-8YYC.m4a" length="28222875" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:28</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZnVGxLeVZZdnNsdXlQVmRWTF9fNXZoUDlERDYucG5n.png"/>
